uh... you know at one of the meetings sure you know uh... so the the wednesday all recovery group like i said from four thirty to five thirty at city hall uh... food is provided pizza salad chicken fingers and it's a different approach to your standard a a n n a meetings uh... the majority of people seem to go to one or the other there's a ton of meetings and i'm open to any meeting okay uh...

